## Parts Needed

The parts needed to assemble Project Ankaa are listed below:

1. **Arduino Mega 2560** — Other Arduino boards may work, though Project Ankaa was designed around the Mega 2560.
2. **Arduino Mega Sensor Shield** — Project Ankaa was originally built using the **KEYESTUDIO MEGA Sensor Shield Prototype Board for Arduino MEGA R3 2560**. Other compatible Mega sensor/expansion shields may also work.
3. **6× 9g Servos** — Each eye module requires two servos (four total), with the remaining two servos used for the jaw.
